{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55145","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"课惊怖，日上细寻推。\n辰巳太冲加日上，若逢蛇雀见凶危，复手也如之。\n（大吉加日，宜急去，不可住，辰上见太冲，夜必有风雨，若神後太乙加日辰，夜有贼盗。\n旺相必见，无气则不见。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}